  "html": "<p id=\"mwSQ\"><b id=\"mwSg\">Portugal</b>,<sup about=\"#mwt75\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-14\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"group\":\"lower-alpha\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-14\"},\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"efn\",\"href\":\"./Template:Efn\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"{{IPA|PT-pt|puɾtuˈɣal|audio=Portugal.wav|help=no}}\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'><a href=\"./Portugal#cite_note-14\" data-mw-group=\"lower-alpha\" id=\"mwSw\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwTA\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwTQ\">[</span>c<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwTg\">]</span></span></a></sup> officially the <b id=\"mwTw\">Portuguese Republic</b>,<sup about=\"#mwt82\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-15\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"group\":\"lower-alpha\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-15\"},\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"efn\",\"href\":\"./Template:Efn\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"{{langx|PT-pt|República Portuguesa|links=no}}, {{IPA|PT-pt|rɛˈpuβlikɐ puɾtuˈɣez̻ɐ|IPA|help=no}}\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'><a href=\"./Portugal#cite_note-15\" data-mw-group=\"lower-alpha\" id=\"mwUA\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwUQ\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwUg\">[</span>d<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwUw\">]</span></span></a></sup> is a country in <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"./Southwestern_Europe\" title=\"Southwestern Europe\" class=\"mw-redirect\" id=\"mwVA\">Southwestern Europe</a>. <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"./Continental_Portugal\" title=\"Continental Portugal\" id=\"mwVQ\">Mainland Portugal</a> is located on the southwestern portion of the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"./Iberian_Peninsula\" title=\"Iberian Peninsula\" id=\"mwVg\">Iberian Peninsula</a>, and <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"./Portugal–Spain_border\" title=\"Portugal–Spain border\" id=\"mwVw\">bordered</a> by Spain to the north and east. Portugal also includes the archipelagos of <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"./Madeira\" title=\"Madeira\" id=\"mwWA\">Madeira</a> and the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"./Azores\" title=\"Azores\" id=\"mwWQ\">Azores</a> in the Atlantic Ocean. The country has a population of 11.4<span class=\"nowrap\" about=\"#mwt87\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"nbsp\",\"href\":\"./Template:Nbsp\"},\"params\":{},\"i\":0}}]}' id=\"mwWg\"><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span></span>million, and <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"./Lisbon\" title=\"Lisbon\" id=\"mwWw\">Lisbon</a>, its capital, is the largest city. Portugal's internal waters and territorial sea together account for two-fifths of its territory, and <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"./Exclusive_economic_zone_of_Portugal\" title=\"Exclusive economic zone of Portugal\" id=\"mwXA\">its exclusive economic zone</a> is one of Europe's largest. The country's terrain contains a diverse range of landscapes and regional climates.</p>\n\n<p id=\"mwXQ\">The territory of present-day Portugal has been inhabited since the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"./Paleolithic\" title=\"Paleolithic\" id=\"mwXg\">Paleolithic</a>. The <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"./County_of_Portugal\" title=\"County of Portugal\" id=\"mwXw\">County of Portugal</a> emerged in 868 during the Christian expansion into <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"./Al-Andalus\" title=\"Al-Andalus\" id=\"mwYA\">Al-Andalus</a>. <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"./Afonso_I_of_Portugal\" title=\"Afonso I of Portugal\" id=\"mwYQ\">Afonso Henriques</a> assumed the title of king, recognised by León-Castile in 1143 and by the papacy in 1179.<sup about=\"#mwt93\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-16\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-16\"}}'><a href=\"./Portugal#cite_note-16\" id=\"mwYg\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwYw\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwZA\">[</span>12<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwZQ\">]</span></span></a></sup>During the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"./Age_of_Discovery\" title=\"Age of Discovery\" id=\"mwZg\">Age of Discovery</a>, the kingdom made several advancements in nautical science and maritime exploration to discover new territories and sea routes, which led to the establishment of the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"./Portuguese_Empire\" title=\"Portuguese Empire\" id=\"mwZw\">Portuguese Empire</a>. The kingdom <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"./5_October_1910_revolution\" title=\"5 October 1910 revolution\" id=\"mwaA\">became a republic</a> in <span about=\"#mwt88\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"YEAR\",\"href\":\"./Template:YEAR\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"1910\"}},\"i\":0}}]}' id=\"mwaQ\">1910</span>, before <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"./28_May_1926_coup_d'état\" title=\"28 May 1926 coup d'état\" id=\"mwag\">becoming a dictatorship</a> in <span about=\"#mwt89\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"YEAR\",\"href\":\"./Template:YEAR\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"1926\"}},\"i\":0}}]}' id=\"mwaw\">1926</span>, whose <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"./Carnation_Revolution\" title=\"Carnation Revolution\" id=\"mwbA\">1974 overthrow</a> enabled democracy to be established in <span about=\"#mwt90\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"YEAR\",\"href\":\"./Template:YEAR\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"1976\"}},\"i\":0}}]}' id=\"mwbQ\">1976</span>.</p>\n\n<p id=\"mwbg\">Portugal is a unitary republic and multi-party representative democracy with four separate <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"./Sovereignty_body_(Portugal)\" title=\"Sovereignty body (Portugal)\" id=\"mwbw\">sovereignty organs</a>: president, government, parliament, and judiciary. It has a unicameral national legislature known as the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"./Assembly_of_the_Republic_(Portugal)\" title=\"Assembly of the Republic (Portugal)\" id=\"mwcA\">Assembly of the Republic</a> (<span title=\"Portuguese-language text\" about=\"#mwt94\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"lang\",\"href\":\"./Template:Lang\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"pt\"},\"2\":{\"wt\":\"Assembleia da República\"}},\"i\":0}}]}' id=\"mwcQ\"><i lang=\"pt\">Assembleia da República</i></span><link rel=\"mw:PageProp/Category\" href=\"./Category:Articles_containing_Portuguese-language_text\" about=\"#mwt94\" id=\"mwcg\"/>). Portugal is divided into <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"./NUTS_statistical_regions_of_Portugal\" title=\"NUTS statistical regions of Portugal\" id=\"mwcw\">seven mainland regions</a> and <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"./Autonomous_regions_of_Portugal\" title=\"Autonomous regions of Portugal\" id=\"mwdA\">two autonomous overseas regions</a>, though it remains a highly centralised country.</p>\n\n<p id=\"mwdQ\">A <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"./Developed_country\" title=\"Developed country\" id=\"mwdg\">developed country</a>, Portugal has an advanced economy that chiefly relies upon services, industry, and tourism. Its <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"./Culture_of_Portugal\" title=\"Culture of Portugal\" id=\"mwdw\">culture</a>, rooted in western Iberia and shaped particularly by Romanisation and subsequent European and Atlantic influences, has had a worldwide influence.<sup about=\"#mwt100\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-17\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-17\"}}'><a href=\"./Portugal#cite_note-17\" id=\"mweA\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mweQ\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mweg\">[</span>13<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwew\">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about=\"#mwt103\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-18\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-18\"}}'><a href=\"./Portugal#cite_note-18\" id=\"mwfA\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwfQ\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwfg\">[</span>14<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwfw\">]</span></span></a></sup> This allowed Portuguese to become the world's <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"./List_of_languages_by_number_of_native_speakers\" title=\"List of languages by number of native speakers\" id=\"mwgA\">fifth-most spoken native language</a>, with more than 250<span class=\"nowrap\" about=\"#mwt95\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"nbsp\",\"href\":\"./Template:Nbsp\"},\"params\":{},\"i\":0}}]}' id=\"mwgQ\"><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span></span>million<span class=\"nowrap\" about=\"#mwt96\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"nbsp\",\"href\":\"./Template:Nbsp\"},\"params\":{},\"i\":0}}]}' id=\"mwgg\"><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span></span>native<span class=\"nowrap\" about=\"#mwt97\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"nbsp\",\"href\":\"./Template:Nbsp\"},\"params\":{},\"i\":0}}]}' id=\"mwgw\"><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span></span>speakers. With a stable foreign policy shaped by its colonial and diplomatic history and location, Portugal is a member of <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"./International_organization_membership_of_Portugal\" title=\"International organization membership of Portugal\" id=\"mwhA\">multiple international organisations and forums</a>.</p>\n\n<meta property=\"mw:PageProp/toc\" data-mw='{\"autoGenerated\":true}' id=\"mwhQ\"/></section><section data-mw-section-id=\"1\" id=\"mwhg\"><h2 id=\"Etymology\">Etymology</h2>\n\n<p id=\"mwhw\">The word <span class=\"anchor\" id=\"Name\" about=\"#mwt104\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"anchor\",\"href\":\"./Template:Anchor\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"Name\"},\"2\":{\"wt\":\"Etymology\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'></span><span class=\"anchor\" id=\"mwiA\" about=\"#mwt104\" data-x-id=\"Etymology\"></span> <i id=\"mwiQ\">Portugal</i> derives from <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"./Latin\" title=\"Latin\" id=\"mwig\">Latin</a> <span title=\"Latin-language text\" about=\"#mwt105\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"lang\",\"href\":\"./Template:Lang\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"la\"},\"2\":{\"wt\":\"[[Portus Cale]]\"}},\"i\":0}}]}' id=\"mwiw\"><i lang=\"la\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"./Portus_Cale\" title=\"Portus Cale\">Portus Cale</a></i></span><link rel=\"mw:PageProp/Category\" href=\"./Category:Articles_containing_Latin-language_text\" about=\"#mwt105\" id=\"mwjA\"/>, a <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"./Ancient_Rome\" title=\"Ancient Rome\" id=\"mwjQ\">Roman</a> name meaning 'port of <span title=\"Latin-language text\" about=\"#mwt106\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"lang\",\"href\":\"./Template:Lang\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"la\"},\"2\":{\"wt\":\"Cale\"}},\"i\":0}}]}' id=\"mwjg\"><i lang=\"la\">Cale</i></span><link rel=\"mw:PageProp/Category\" href=\"./Category:Articles_containing_Latin-language_text\" about=\"#mwt106\" id=\"mwjw\"/>', itself the origin of the name of the Portuguese city of <span title=\"Portuguese-language text\" about=\"#mwt107\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"lang\",\"href\":\"./Template:Lang\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"pt\"},\"2\":{\"wt\":\"[[Porto]]\"}},\"i\":0}}]}' id=\"mwkA\"><i lang=\"pt\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"./Porto\" title=\"Porto\">Porto</a></i></span><link rel=\"mw:PageProp/Category\" href=\"./Category:Articles_containing_Portuguese-language_text\" about=\"#mwt107\" id=\"mwkQ\"/>, while <i id=\"mwkg\">Cale</i> was a town on the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"./Douro\" title=\"Douro\" id=\"mwkw\">Douro</a>. There is no consensus on the etymology of <i id=\"mwlA\">Cale</i>. It could derive from the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"./Pre-Indo-European_languages\" title=\"Pre-Indo-European languages\" id=\"mwlQ\">pre-Indo-European</a> word <i id=\"mwlg\">Kala</i>, meaning 'shelter' or 'refuge', passed into the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"./Callaecian_language\" title=\"Callaecian language\" id=\"mwlw\">Celtic language</a> in the form <i id=\"mwmA\">Cale</i>, with the meaning of 'land' or 'mountain'. The <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"./Ethnonym\" title=\"Ethnonym\" id=\"mwmQ\">ethnonym</a> <i id=\"mwmg\">Calaico/a</i> then came from the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"./Gallaeci\" title=\"Gallaeci\" id=\"mwmw\">Gallaeci</a>, Celtic peoples of northwestern Iberia, and came to mean 'one of the land' or 'one of the place.<sup about=\"#mwt108\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FOOTNOTECarvalho202276–79_19-0\" reld=\"2\" id=\"mwug\"><h2 id=\"History\">History</h2>\n<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt124\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"Main\",\"href\":\"./Template:Main\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"History of Portugal\"}},\"i\":0}}]}' id=\"mwuw\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237\" about=\"#mwt125\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Module:Hatnote/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/></span><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\" about=\"#mwt124\" id=\"mwvA\">Main article: <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"./History_of_Portugal\" title=\"History of Portugal\">History of Portugal</a></div>\n\n<section data-mw-section-id=\"3\" id=\"mwvQ\"><h3 id=\"Prehistory\">Prehistory</h3>\n<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt126\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"Main\",\"href\":\"./Template:Main\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"Prehistoric Iberia\"}},\"i\":0}}]}' id=\"mwvg\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237\" about=\"#mwt127\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Module:Hatnote/styles.css\"},\"body\":{\"extsrc\":\"\"}}'/></span><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\" about=\"#mwt126\" id=\"mwvw\">Main article: <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"./Prehistoric_Iberia\" title=\"Prehistoric Iberia\">Prehistoric Iberia</a></div>\n\n<p id=\"mwwA\">The region has been inhabited by humans since approximately 400,000<span class=\"nowrap\" about=\"#mwt128\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"nbsp\",\"href\":\"./Template:Nbsp\"},\"params\":{},\"i\":0}}]}' id=\"mwwQ\"><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span></span>years<span class=\"nowrap\" about=\"#mwt129\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"nbsp\",\"href\":\"./Template:Nbsp\"},\"params\":{},\"i\":0}}]}' id=\"mwwg\"><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span></span>ago.<sup about=\"#mwt130\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-25\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"group\":\"lower-alpha\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-25\"},\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"efn\",\"href\":\"./Template:Efn\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"The earliest human trace found in Portugal is the 400,000-year-old [[Aroeira 3]], a {{lang|la|[[Homo heidelbergensis]]}} skull discovered in the [[Cave of Aroeira]] in 2014.{{sfnp|Daura|Sanz|Arsuaga|Hoffmann|2017|pp=3397-3399,3401}}\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'><a href=\"./Portugal#cite_note-25\" data-mw-group=\"lower-alpha\" id=\"mwww\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwxA\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwxQ\">[</span>e<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwxg\">]</span></span></a></sup> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"./Neanderthal\" title=\"Neanderthal\" id=\"mwxw\">Neanderthals</a> inhabited the southwestern Iberian Peninsula until around 37,000<span class=\"nowrap\" about=\"#mwt136\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"nbsp\",\"href\":\"./Template:Nbsp\"},\"params\":{},\"i\":0}}]}' id=\"mwyA\"><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span></span>years<span class=\"nowrap\" about=\"#mwt137\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"nbsp\",\"href\":\"./Template:Nbsp\"},\"params\":{},\"i\":0}}]}' id=\"mwyQ\"><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span></span>ago,<sup about=\"#mwt138\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FOOTNOTEZilhãoCardosoPikeWeninger201193_26-0\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"group\":\"\",\"name\":\"FOOTNOTEZilhãoCardosoPikeWeninger201193\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-FOOTNOTEZilhãoCardosoPikeWeninger201193-26\"},\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"sfnp\",\"href\":\"./Template:Sfnp\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"Zilhão\"},\"2\":{\"wt\":\"Cardoso\"},\"3\":{\"wt\":\"Pike\"},\"4\":{\"wt\":\"Weninger\"},\"5\":{\"wt\":\"2011\"},\"p\":{\"wt\":\"93\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'><a href=\"./Portugal#cite_note-FOOTNOTEZilhãoCardosoPikeWeninger201193-26\" id=\"mwyg\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwyw\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwzA\">[</span>21<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwzQ\">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about=\"#mwt141\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FOOTNOTEZilhãod'ErricoBanksTeyssandier202443_27-0\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"group\":\"\",\"name\":\"FOOTNOTEZilhãod&apos;ErricoBanksTeyssandier202443\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-FOOTNOTEZilhãod&apos;ErricoBanksTeyssandier202443-27\"},\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"sfnp\",\"href\":\"./Template:Sfnp\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"Zilhão\"},\"2\":{\"wt\":\"d&apos;Errico\"},\"3\":{\"wt\":\"Banks\"},\"4\":{\"wt\":\"Teyssandier\"},\"5\":{\"wt\":\"2024\"},\"p\":{\"wt\":\"43\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'><a href=\"./Portugal#cite_note-FOOTNOTEZilhãod'ErricoBanksTeyssandier202443-27\" id=\"mwzg\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwzw\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mw0A\">[</span>22<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mw0Q\">]</span></span></a></sup> and <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"./Anatomically_modern_human\" title=\"Anatomically modern human\" class=\"mw-redirect\" id=\"mw0g\">anatomically modern humans</a> were present in what is now Portugal by around 40,000<span class=\"nowrap\" about=\"#mwt144\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"nbsp\",\"href\":\"./Template:Nbsp\"},\"params\":{},\"i\":0}}]}' id=\"mw0w\"><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span></span>years<span class=\"nowrap\" about=\"#mwt145\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"nbsp\",\"href\":\"./Template:Nbsp\"},\"params\":{},\"i\":0}}]}' id=\"mw1A\"><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span></span>ago.<sup about=\"#mwt146\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FOOTNOTEShaoKleinWegenerWeniger202515,_18–22_28-0\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"group\":\"\",\"name\":\"FOOTNOTEShaoKleinWegenerWeniger202515, 18–22\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-FOOTNOTEShaoKleinWegenerWeniger202515,_18–22-28\"},\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"sfnp\",\"href\":\"./Template:Sfnp\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"Shao\"},\"2\":{\"wt\":\"Klein\"},\"3\":{\"wt\":\"Wegener\"},\"4\":{\"wt\":\"Weniger\"},\"5\":{\"wt\":\"2025\"},\"pp\":{\"wt\":\"15,18-22\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'><a href=\"./Portugal#cite_note-FOOTNOTEShaoKleinWegenerWeniger202515,_18–22-28\" id=\"mw1Q\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mw1g\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mw1w\">[</span>23<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mw2A\">]</span></span></a></sup> The <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"./Neolithic_Europe\" title=\"Neolithic Europe\" id=\"mw2Q\">Neolithic</a> began between 5500<span class=\"nowrap\" about=\"#mwt149\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"spaces\",\"href\":\"./Template:Spaces\"},\"params\":{},\"i\":0}}]}' id=\"mw2g\"><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span></span>BC and 5300<span class=\"nowrap\" about=\"#mwt150\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"spaces\",\"href\":\"./Template:Spaces\"},\"params\":{},\"i\":0}}]}' id=\"mw2w\"><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span></span>BC.<sup about=\"#mwt151\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FOOTNOTEPeyroteo-Stjerna2021265–299_29-0\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"group\":\"\",\"name\":\"FOOTNOTEPeyroteo-Stjerna2021265–299\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-FOOTNOTEPeyroteo-Stjerna2021265–299-29\"},\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"sfnp\",\"href\":\"./Template:Sfnp\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"Peyroteo-Stjerna\"},\"2\":{\"wt\":\"2021\"},\"pp\":{\"wt\":\"265–299\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'><a href=\"./Portugal#cite_note-FOOTNOTEPeyroteo-Stjerna2021265–299-29\" id=\"mw3A\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mw3Q\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mw3g\">[</span>24<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mw3w\">]</span></span></a></sup> In southern Portugal, <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"./Iron_Age_Europe\" title=\"Iron Age Europe\" id=\"mw4A\">Iron Age</a> inscribed <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"./Stele\" title=\"Stele\" id=\"mw4Q\">stele</a> provide early evidence of writing in the Iberian Peninsula.<sup about=\"#mwt154\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FOOTNOTELuján_Martínez2020561–589_30-0\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"group\":\"\",\"name\":\"FOOTNOTELuján Martínez2020561–589\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-FOOTNOTELuján_Martínez2020561–589-30\"},\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"sfnp\",\"href\":\"./Template:Sfnp\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"Luján Martínez\"},\"2\":{\"wt\":\"2020\"},\"pp\":{\"wt\":\"561–589\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'><a href=\"./Portugal#cite_note-FOOTNOTELuján_Martínez2020561–589-30\" id=\"mw4g\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mw4w\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mw5A\">[</span>25<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mw5Q\">]</span></span></a></sup></p>\n\n<p id=\"mw5g\">During the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"./Iron_Age\" title=\"Iron Age\" id=\"mw5w\">Iron Age</a>, northern Portugal formed part of the northwestern Iberian <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"./Castro_culture\" title=\"Castro culture\" id=\"mw6A\">Castro culture</a>, characterised by fortified settlements known as <i id=\"mw6Q\">castros</i>.<sup about=\"#mwt172\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-31\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-31\"}}'><a href=\"./Portugal#cite_note-31\" id=\"mw6g\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mw6w\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mw7A\">[</span>26<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mw7Q\">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about=\"#mwt175\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-32\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-32\"}}'><a href=\"./Portugal#cite_note-32\" id=\"mw7g\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mw7w\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mw8A\">[</span>27<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mw8Q\">]</span></span></a></sup> Peoples recorded in western Iberia included the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"./Gallaeci\" title=\"Gallaeci\" id=\"mw8g\">Gallaeci</a>, <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"./Lusitanians\" title=\"Lusitanians\" id=\"mw8w\">Lusitanians</a> and <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"./Celtici\" title=\"Celtici\" id=\"mw9A\">Celtici</a>, alongside other regional groups; Celtic languages and identities are attested in parts of the region, although their extent and relationship to archaeological cultures remain debated.<sup about=\"#mwt157\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FOOTNOTEGorbea2023251–254_33-0\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"group\":\"\",\"name\":\"FOOTNOTEGorbea2023251–254\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-FOOTNOTEGorbea2023251–254-33\"},\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"sfnp\",\"href\":\"./Template:Sfnp\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"Gorbea\"},\"2\":{\"wt\":\"2023\"},\"pp\":{\"wt\":\"251-254\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'><a href=\"./Portugal#cite_note-FOOTNOTEGorbea2023251–254-33\" id=\"mw9Q\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mw9g\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mw9w\">[</span>28<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mw-A\">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about=\"#mwt160\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FOOTNOTEAlarcão2001322–324_34-0\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"group\":\"\",\"name\":\"FOOTNOTEAlarcão2001322–324\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-FOOTNOTEAlarcão2001322–324-34\"},\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"sfnp\",\"href\":\"./Template:Sfnp\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"Alarcão\"},\"2\":{\"wt\":\"2001\"},\"pp\":{\"wt\":\"322-324\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'><a href=\"./Portugal#cite_note-FOOTNOTEAlarcão2001322–324-34\" id=\"mw-Q\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mw-g\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mw-w\">[</span>29<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mw_A\">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about=\"#mwt163\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FOOTNOTESims-Williams2020523_35-0\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"group\":\"\",\"name\":\"FOOTNOTESims-Williams2020523\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-FOOTNOTESims-Williams2020523-35\"},\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"sfnp\",\"href\":\"./Template:Sfnp\"},"
}